{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《魔音女團》爆淘汰戰！鄧凱文跳唱狂甩beat兼嚴重走音，激嬲陳奐仁慘成「老鼠屎」！不過她憑藉低胸衫性感上陣，成功令人錯Fo搶盡風頭。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129193984317460480068243.jpeg/sGIB8ONFtBaLo0idRjV0kbJnOlqqaByk8s1Wd_LNVnc\" alt=\"正式訓練！（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>正式訓練！（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129193986829979648591864.jpeg/LQQFzjHFdAd2evBblEgCTzYAUrsF9dRQQMLd9UDC3fU\" alt=\"正式訓練！（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>正式訓練！（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129193989191503872508647.jpeg/4Q3iI5CRk1Xa3JWRuQDMxowtbFOvho_6DH3d1gx93dY\" alt=\"盧映彤表示自己成日肚餓。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>盧映彤表示自己成日肚餓。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129193991364284416401697.jpeg/rY9-JEbLrG0oY6H7G5Kr_nS20FH-4uQQFjmnMhY5pzI\" alt=\"「班主任」陳奐仁勁頭痛。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>「班主任」陳奐仁勁頭痛。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129193993998438400093645.jpeg/KE8icgA0bHejwfZNK2XTX3-qW7wzo8XfyNsSOcjbEjk\" alt=\"鄧凱文話壓力大忍唔住食嘢。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>鄧凱文話壓力大忍唔住食嘢。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>宋宛穎盧映彤鄧凱文倪嘉雯「原地出道」？</p><p>第四集中，鄧凱文、宋宛穎、盧映彤、倪嘉雯組成一組。「班主任」陳潔靈（Miss Chan Chan）教授唱歌呼吸法，「班主任」陳奐仁則指要從身形及髮型上着手。倪嘉雯說：「我諗⋯⋯我應該唔使減。」陳奐仁卻回答：「你需要減，減3%到4%脂肪率。你幾多公斤？」倪嘉雯：「49。」陳奐仁：「你需要食4.5匙蛋白粉。」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194141016657920321940.jpeg/fJmRwXhRO3XA8A0saE6zpfAuus2unBqJdmKEN3ZihDc\" alt=\"宋宛穎表現平穩。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>宋宛穎表現平穩。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194143768252416219678.jpeg/DK4eLq_jBC-LbwFMdTD35kv5Z6OV0sdl31gex99YHsc\" alt=\"鄧凱文話唔想自己成為「老鼠屎」。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>鄧凱文話唔想自己成為「老鼠屎」。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194151163203584104965.jpeg/GwE8v5Sv4Z66PNsiVp_ZgGVQOsSmTjArwrpMusK6TLo\" alt=\"宋宛穎直言唔想放棄鄧凱文，話佢好努力。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>宋宛穎直言唔想放棄鄧凱文，話佢好努力。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194146595344384587031.jpeg/PMxK8Dmg6iXXLuNq43RgvYWGNX2zxun1Bm2OwQZtjsE\" alt=\"鄧凱文唱歌都係走音。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>鄧凱文唱歌都係走音。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194148893954048028175.jpeg/rOjM2x9L2ZYdNaOzs_qT14Rm4NjmmoTImb9a-pm_Wvo\" alt=\"陳奐仁頂唔住掟譜。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>陳奐仁頂唔住掟譜。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194139401850880472803.jpeg/SQjziz_8clUGh6qIWUNrHxQWwbv4gx89_8e-mf_Hvpk\" alt=\"鄧凱文真情流露。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>鄧凱文真情流露。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194142568681472463927.jpeg/lWjAsvn0EOtxAbu2U0vfAHXhsbBX-HSqXB97OVwfezk\" alt=\"鄧凱文真情流露。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>鄧凱文真情流露。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>鄧凱文成「老鼠屎」</p><p>盧映彤又言：「我成日都會肚餓⋯⋯」聽到答案後，陳奐仁表現得勁無奈。鄧凱文也說：「我忍唔住食宵夜，尋晚食咗芝士麵包⋯⋯」眾人排舞時，鄧凱文經常甩beat，更言：「我唔想自己成為一個老鼠屎，我亦都會盡力令自己唔會成為老鼠屎。」與陳奐仁練唱歌時，鄧凱文更唱不到音準，令陳奐仁急得掟音樂譜。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194415588380672579340.jpeg/hVOxr8lynlPjJFczCx6JzHVSDCaBaI6efj--d34_vnc\" alt=\"正式表演。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>正式表演。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194418067345408947513.jpeg/W_5W14-crpPPfZ9boOcOEGN0fEnpWAN12njw-9p48Ps\" alt=\"正式表演。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>正式表演。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194420353372160203587.jpeg/MSxAdtI0wRADZ7VFHeNbr2MaQ3RDiZ2BeFsoFHhbKBQ\" alt=\"似樣喎。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>似樣喎。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194425357438976216780.jpeg/P_zCesN8_7QZp5SIrIecLY2woy2YjD5QHxoB_x8aAf8\" alt=\"不過鄧凱文一開聲就出事。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>不過鄧凱文一開聲就出事。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194422949777408930781.jpeg/an8Crp3fH3XshtRm7Uqs2LAnwHvHBEy4dp-oV3afqFc\" alt=\"鄧凱文低胸衫好搶鏡。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>鄧凱文低胸衫好搶鏡。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1129194414057459712701826.jpeg/fzIKFrZArEYdlbKXIRnRKpYF8k6sxDLvpk15EaZNeRE\" alt=\"最後順利完成。（《魔音女團》截圖）\"><figcaption>最後順利完成。（《魔音女團》截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T16:22:28.302379+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":761,"images":18,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}